Z||000000||lowCG||01-11-2000||06:37 PM||||After an exhilerating drive that started in Tacoma washington,I've made the(100mph)pilgrimage to the motor city where I've made my break into the auto styling business.<BR>Another month(!)in motels,fighting cockroaches with 409 cleaner and Scotchtape-booby traps while waiting for my house to get the finishing touches,and I'm here,yeah!<BR>And back online. The Fiero never missed a beat,and is still running fine after it's suspension transplant back in Washington.||||reg||7
