Z||000004||william_thorniii||01-12-2000||12:04 AM||||Congratulations on your successful journey and entering the difficult field of automotive design.  An interesting note is that while I was going to school in Flint, I met people that every three months (our school/work terms are on 3 mo. intervals) would drive from LA and Colorado Springs to Flint.  Talk about racking up the miles.  You will learn to love Detroit.  There are so many neat things there and so much history.  You will soon learn to drive like the locals too, then you will really stick out when you return to WA.  Perhaps I will see you at Cobo (the autoshow) either this weekend or next. <P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||10
