Z||000007||lowCG||01-11-2000||06:31 PM||||Thanks all,funny really,most of the people that I meet here have all had the same response of "why did you come HERE from WA?",but I take it these aren't really car buffs either.I do like the people here,job's great,just need to pick up on the big-brake project where I left off,and yes,read some posts that I've missed.I don't however,work for the folks that made are cars.<BR>I'm anticipating a 3.4 twincam sometime soon;before I left,I checked the Insurance Auto Auction site,and they had around ten wrecks in the area that could supply this(as opposed to one in the entire Northwest).||||reg||1
